  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Tax Programme MDTF World Bank 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Tax Program Multi-Donor Trust Fund is the main vehicle in the World Bank&#x2019;s support to Domestic Resource Mobilization (DRM) in developing countries. Supporting the programme is an active contribution to the achievement of the outcomes in The Seville Commitment (Compromiso de Sevilla) emanating from the fourth conference on Financing for Development (FfD4) which identifies how mobilizing additional domestic public resources and ensuring their effective and efficient use for sustainable development impact requires decisive national action to strengthen fiscal systems, promote their progressivity, build long-term financial resilience, and align them with sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
